speechtext:
I have the honour to inform the House that when the House went up to the Senate Chamber, the Deputy Governor General had been pleased to give in Her Majesty's name the Royal Assent to the following Bills:
Bill C-27, An Act for granting to the Majesty certain sums of money for the Government of Canada for the financial year ending the 31st March, 1984- Chapter No. 3;
Bill C-28, An Act for granting to Her Majesty certain sums of money for the Government of Canada for the financial year ending the 31st March, 1985- Chapter No. 4.
